{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはよう〜(*^^*)\nみさみさです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/11/30/111123_223056_ed.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"題名は若月blogを\n意識してみました。。。。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みゅうみゅうファンの方、\nみゅうみゅう、\nごめんなさい_(._.)_ ぺこり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日のレッスンの帰りに\nななみんに対して\nまいまいが言ったこの言葉が\nみさのドツボにはまり\nしばらく笑いが収まらなかった。\n笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい、さっそく〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなから質問を頂いたので\n答えちゃいますよ(´_ゝ｀)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"①野球は好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好き〜ヾ(^▽^)ﾉ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"兄ちゃんが３歳年上で\nみさ、小学生の頃は\n練習とか試合についていくのが\nあんまり\n好きじゃなかったの(つд｀)\nせっかくの土日休みやに\nいつも野球ばっかりで\nもっとみさの行きたい所にも\n連れてってよ！！と\nひねくれておりました(´_ゝ｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも中学生になってからかな〜\n兄ちゃんが高校野球になってから\nいつのまにか好きになってて、\nルールにも詳しくなって\nそれから野球が面白いって\n大好きになったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プロは、やっぱりお隣の県の\nソフトバンクホークス！\nを応援しています(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも野球に限らずスポーツは\n大好きですよっ＼(^o^)／\n中学の頃は\nバレーボール部やったしね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"②好きな男性のタイプ、服、髪は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夢を追いかけてる人！\nあとは趣味とか話が合ったり\n一緒に居てリラックスできたり\nする人がいいと思うな(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"魅力的な服や髪はみさの中では\nその人に似合っていれば\nＯＫ！って思うよっ(^_^)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"③好きなキャラクターは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダッフィー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマスバージョンの\nダッフィーが欲しい(>_<｡)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ディズニーシー行きたいな♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"④洋楽アーティストは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさは洋楽も聴いたり\nするんですよ〜(´_ゝ｀)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へへ\n意外？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさはIYAZさんが大好きで\n移動の時とかいつも\n聴いてますよー♪\n『solo』『There you Are』\n『OK』『Friend』\nおすすめなので\nぜひ聴いてみて〜♪♪♪\nsoloは1番好きっ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなも、おすすめがあったら\nぜひみさに教えてっ＼(^o^)／☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⑤夕日と夜景どっちが好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっちも綺麗だから\n選べないよ〜〜〜〜っ(>_<｡)\nでも夕日の方が、\n何かジーンとくるかなぁ(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⑥大分県のいい所教えて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっぱいあるよ！？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずは温泉かな〜♪♪\n別府と湯布院の温泉は\n本当にいいです！日本一！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だと思っております( *｀ω´) へい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとは食べ物！\nかぼす、やせうま、しいたけ\nだんご汁、関あじ関さば\nおいしいものいっぱい☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとは本当に住みやすい。\n自然がいっぱいやし\n緑がいっぱい！！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有名人の方だと\n福沢諭吉さん、南こうせつさん\n錦野旦さん、阿倍真央さん\nKEIKOさん、深津絵里さん、\nユースケ・サンタマリアさん\nAKB48 指原莉乃さん\nSKE48 小野晴香さん\n矢方美紀さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他にもたくさん\nご活躍されている方がいます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな大分県が大好き！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⑦サイリウムの色は何色が好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん〜〜〜(>_<)！\nやっぱり乃木坂カラーの紫？！\nかなぁ♪\nでも、みさは赤が好きなので\n赤もいいなぁ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっちも"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きだよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⑧自分の好きなパーツは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん〜目、かなぁ(*^_^*)\nあとは手。\nちょっと、小さいみたい(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、ここまでっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだたくさん受け付けます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそして！！\n今日。待ちに待ったイベント！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついにイベントだ〜(>_<｡)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぅ〜〜〜っ楽しみだけど緊張。\n緊張だけど楽しみ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさかなりの緊張しいだから\nもうドキドキしてるー！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、ひとつのものを作るために\nそれぞれが努力をし\n今日まで一生懸命\n練習を頑張ってきました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なので今日はみなさんに\n期待を裏切らない\n全力のパフォーマンスをお届けします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみにしていてください！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私たちを、見ていてください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は夕方から\n雨が降るみたいなので\n傘を忘れないでくださいね？\n風邪引かないように\n気をつけてください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさみさ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}